#!RuleTest
#test CDISC-AD0719 expect=skipped domain=ADLBC
# Rule:Description: Raise an error when a BDS dataset contains none of the subject-level or record-level treatment variables defined in the IG.
#note "Only trt01a is present — spelled in lower case as a SAS dataset may carry it; column names match case-insensitively on every surface (owner ruling 2026-09-28), templates included. It is a member of the TRTxxA family defined in the IG (ADaMIG 1.1/1.2/1.3 Table 3.2.4 (ADSL treatment variables, any of which may be copied into a BDS dataset)), so the CR719 requirement is met and the Requirements.Variables.None entry TRTxxA skips the rule."
dataset ADLBC
col STUDYID type=Char
col USUBJID type=Char
col PARAMCD type=Char
col AVAL type=Num
col trt01a type=Char
---
CDISCPILOT01 | 01-701-1015 | ALT | 12.5 | X
---
